title: Remove deprecated build-spec CLI subcommand
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary

    - Remove the deprecated `build-spec` CLI subcommand and `BuildSpecCmd` from `sc-cli`.
    - Migrate all callers (nodes, templates, scripts, docs, zombienet) to `export-chain-spec`.

    Part of #11561
crates:
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-cli
  bump: major
- name: staging-chain-spec-builder
  bump: major
- name: sc-cli
  bump: major
